etadata field is not consistent, set it to null.\n   - Metadata keys:\n       - location\n       - subject_matter\n       - industry\n       - time  (represents WHEN the event occurred, not when published)\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with this structure:\n\n{\n  "subject": "...",\n  "predicate": "...",\n  "object": "...",\n  "metadata": {\n    "location": "... or null",\n    "subject_matter": "... or null",\n    "industry": "... or null",\n    "time": "... or null"\n  }\n}\n\nHere are the RawRecords:\n\nID: 4176857\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: prnewswire.com\nSLUG: siteimprove-establece-un-nuevo-estandar-para-que-la-inteligencia-de-contenido-triunfe-en-la-busqueda-con-ia-302795975-html\nTEXT: Siteimprove establishes new standard for AI content success with the launch of its Agent optimization and redaction of content and PDF correction agent. The new agents help clients identify visibility gaps in AI, correct automatically problems and ensure content meets standards and is ready for search by AI. Siteimprove.ai\'s latest version advances the company\'s vision of a unified content intelligence agent platform. The launch reflects a fundamental truth among Siteimprove\'s corporate clients: accessible content is prepared for AI. The structure, semantics and clarity of content that meets accessibility standards are precisely what search engines need to increase brand visibility and trust in content.\n\nID: 4176858\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: prnewswire.com\nSLUG: siteimprove-setzt-neue-mawstabe-fur-content-intelligence-um-bei-der-ki-suche-erfolgreich-zu-sein-unternehmensinhalte-die-zielgerichtet-und-relevant-gestaltet-sind-nicht-nur-auf-geschwindigkeit-ausgelegt-302795982-html\nTEXT: Siteimprove, a content intelligence platform, has introduced two new agents: Content Writing & Optimization Agent and PDF Remediation Agent. The tools aim to identify gaps in AI-sightability, automate problem-solving and ensure content is compliant with AI search requirements. CEO Nayaki Nayyar emphasizes the importance of barrier-free content, stating that it is essential for AI-friendliness. The platform integrates barrierefreiheit, content strategy, search and analytics in a single solution for enterprise teams. Siteimprove was founded in 2003 and is currently owned by Nordic Capital, with a presence in major global companies, governments and educational institutions.\n\n\n',)
