2023. Hilton became a U.S. citizen in 2021 and often mentions his parents\' experience fleeing communism in Hungary as a formative part of his family\'s history.\n\nID: 4177103\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: ocregister.com\nSLUG: steve-hilton-projected-to-advance-in-california-governor-race-joining-xavier-becerra\nTEXT: Steve Hilton, a Republican and former Fox News host, is projected to advance to the general election in California\'s governor race. He will join Xavier Becerra, a Democrat and former Biden administration Cabinet official, in the November general election. Hilton expressed his gratitude for being chosen by Californians to lead the movement for change in California, stating there\'s nowhere better than the state.\n\nID: 4177084\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: scmp.com\nSLUG: us425-trillion-question-becerra-and-hilton-will-face-california-governor\nTEXT: California\'s next governor will succeed Gavin Newsom and take charge of one of the world\'s biggest economies. The race for California governor in November will be a battle between Democrat Xavier Becerra and Republican Steve Hilton. Hilton, a former Fox News commentator backed by President Donald Trump, has won enough votes to advance to the general election.\n\n\n',)
