etadata field is not consistent, set it to null.\n   - Metadata keys:\n       - location\n       - subject_matter\n       - industry\n       - time  (represents WHEN the event occurred, not when published)\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with this structure:\n\n{\n  "subject": "...",\n  "predicate": "...",\n  "object": "...",\n  "metadata": {\n    "location": "... or null",\n    "subject_matter": "... or null",\n    "industry": "... or null",\n    "time": "... or null"\n  }\n}\n\nHere are the RawRecords:\n\nID: 4177461\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: antaranews.com\nSLUG: bi-rate-hike-boosts-investor-confidence-as-rupiah-rebounds\nTEXT: Indonesia\'s central bank, Bank Indonesia (BI), has raised interest rates to defend the rupiah, which has rebounded following severe external pressure. Minister Airlangga emphasized that the country\'s core economic fundamentals remain robust, driven by strong export performance and solid macroeconomic indicators. Data from the Central Statistics Agency (BPS) shows the Indonesian economy grew 5.61% year-on-year in Q1 2026. The minister noted that Indonesia\'s agricultural sector is uniquely secure, with the country exporting approximately 1.5 million tons of urea to regional countries. This stability is expected to support the rupiah exchange rate, which is forecasted to strengthen to Rp16,800-17,500 per US dollar in 2027.\n\nID: 4176083\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: hurriyetdailynews.com\nSLUG: indonesias-central-bank-unveils-surprise-rate-hike-to-stem-rupiah-rout-223071\nTEXT: Indonesia\'s Central Bank Unveils Surprise Rate Hike to Stem Rupiah Rout. The central bank lifted borrowing costs to 5.5 percent, following an unexpected 50-point increase last month aimed at stabilizing the weakening rupiah and battling inflation. The move came ahead of its next monthly monetary policy meeting, a week away. Jakarta\'s main stock index rose nearly five percent in Tuesday morning trade. The rupiah has fallen to more than 18,000 to the dollar, a record low, stung by surging energy costs.\n\n\n',)
